<p>You won't need to change anything in the forums. They will change with your username (And its alright if the staff posts are wrong as they are generally reply's).</p>
<p>Koth was taken by some other user back in 2010. You probably won't get anywhere with the non-existent employees of wikidot and since staff doesn't own it, nobody can just give you the name. Chances are the user isn't even active so they won't change their name if you ask. I think usernames are not case-sensitive, but your welcome to try.</p>
<p>I hope this was helpful</p>

